This covers everything in this repository: the C47 calculator programs (programs/,
programs_rem/, listings/, build/), the PC tools (python/, tools/), the tests and the
documentation - with this exception:
  - python/stdfont.py and python/tinyfont.py: glyph data from the C43/C47 firmware's
    standardFont and tinyFont, (c) the C43/C47 authors, GPL-3.0.
python/c47sim.py comes from Almanac 47 (same author, GPL-3.0).
Element data (python/elements.py): atomic weights from the IUPAC periodic table (CIAAW abridged standard
atomic weights 2024); state, boiling point and electron configuration from the PubChem periodic table (NCBI).

